摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Sky: Children of the Light themed skin for DeepSeek Harness web UI - light children on a glowing star map, candlelight gold and starry night. 光遇·遇境主题皮肤。","id":"gh:1345754923","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-sky-skin","slug":"QinpanWan/dsh-sky-skin","topics":["cotl","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","harmonyos","skin","sky","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Sky: Children of the Light themed skin for DeepSeek Harness web UI - light children on a glowing sta"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r map, candlelight gold and starry night. 光遇·遇境主题皮肤。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-sky-skin · Sky · Home Arena"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **Sky: Children of the Light** themed skin for the DeepSeek Harness **web** UI —\nthree Light Child"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ren standing on a glowing constellation board, candlelight\ngold and a deep-blue starry night. The li"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ght theme shows two silhouettes\nagainst the setting sun."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Map themes"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Seven map themes ship with the skin, each with its own backdrop and color\npalette, switchable in one"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" click from the dedicated **光遇·遇境** section in\nSettings — no restart, hot-applied instantly:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **遇境 Home** — night sky, glowing star-map board, arched halos (default).\n- **晨岛 Dawn** — morning l"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ight, breathing sun glow.\n- **云野 Prairie** — drifting cloud sea.\n- **雨林 Forest** — rain-damp forest "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"with fireflies.\n- **霞谷 Valley** — rosy valley sheen.\n- **暮土 Wasteland** — dark golden dust.\n- **禁阁 V"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ault** — deep-blue vault starlight."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The active map is persisted in the `ui-sky` settings namespace\n(`GET|POST /api/sky-skin/map`) and ap"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"plies immediately to the open page."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Visuals"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Dark**: night sky, glowing star-map board, arched halos, central candle.\n- **Light**: dusk gradi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ent, twin silhouettes against the big sun.\n- Full remap of the official design tokens (light + dark "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"sets).\n- A MutationObserver state machine drives the backdrop, candle glow and\ndecorations as the ch"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"at activates, the sidebar resizes, and the settings\npanel opens/closes.\n- Decorative chrome: top/bot"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"tom trim, candle corner accents in the sidebar,\na star-map circular mascot, gold-framed chat input.\n"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"- Real raster art served by the host `/sky-assets/` allow-listed route — no SVG."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Then open 设置 → 皮肤 and switch to **光遇·遇境** (or set `ui-skin-sky`\n`disabled: false` in `cordis.patch.y"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ml` and disable the other skins)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Requires the dsh **web** profile. Pure JavaScript — no native dependencies."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Assets"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The raster assets are Wallhaven wallpapers and Sky Fandom official map images\nused as a local person"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"al skin resource (see `skin.json` for per-asset\nsources). The host route only serves the allow-liste"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"d filenames under `assets/`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
